  "solution": {
    "text": "Benzamide on treatment with  <math><mtext>POC</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  gives benzonitrile (phenyl cyanide) because in this reaction  <math><mtext>POC</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  acts as a dehydrating agent and on dehydration of benzamide, benzonitrile is formed.<br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mover><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>"
